  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC15_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "This means you were able to complete the Ritual! You are Bartleby's Scion! I always knew you were special!",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfMoolindaWu_EM2_16.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1459033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Yes! This Wizard was always destined for greatness. But their work is far from over. Now, we must all refocus our efforts upon healing Mellori.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_11.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "She is crucial if we hope to convince Grandmother Raven to spare the Spiral. But time is running out. Mellori refuses to heed my calls.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_12.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC15_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You have been communicating with Mellori, Bartleby?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cow_Wu_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfMoolindaWu_EM2_17.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1459033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Did you think I was talking to myself? Mellori fled Raven's Astral Plane into the place where all minds meet, called the Reverie.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_13.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If she doesn't wake soon, she'll unwittingly cross over to the Other Side, and there will be nothing to protect us from Raven's wrath.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_14.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I will resume pleading to Mellori, but I am still weak. I can grab her attention, but Wizard, you must go to Reverie and convince her to wake.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_15.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But first, you must ensure that her body is alive and well enough for her mind to return to it.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_16.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Take Mellori's mortal form to the point where Life and Death Magic converge: <ITALICS>Mandalla</ITALICS>. Now, make haste, my Scion!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Bartleby_EM2_17.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC15_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I do not envy the task ahead of you, but I am more confident than ever in your abilities, dear Wizard. And so is your former Headmaster.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cow_Wu_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfMoolindaWu_EM2_18.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1459033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC15_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Ambrose has returned to the Arcanum to confer with the Scholars and the Council of Light. You should update them with your news.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cow_Wu_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfMoolindaWu_EM2_19.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1459033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC15_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Hurry back to the Arcanum and update everyone with what you've learned here.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfMoolindaWu_EM2_20.mp3",
